s\": {}, \"temperature\": 30, \"PersonaPrompt\": \"# RAG 回复生成提示词\\n\\n你是一个专业的客服助手。请根据提供的知识库内容回答用户问题。\\n\\n## 回答要求\\n1. 只使用提供的知识库内容，不要编造信息\\n2. 回答要准确、简洁、友好\\n3. 如果知识库中没有相关信息，请诚实告知\\n4. 可以适当添加相关建议或补充信息\\n\\n## 对话历史\\n{{chatHistory}}\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 知识库内容\\n{{knowledgeContent}}\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 用户问题\\n{{e6c2eb0a-de55-421e-bd7c-d16588ab5431_prompt}}\\n\\n---\\n\\n请基于以上知识库内容回答：\\n\", \"knowledgeBase\": [{\"Name\": \"图片知识库\", \"MemberID\": \"\", \"DicIDList\": \"2\", \"ChargeType\": 0, \"CreateTime\": \"2026-05-11T09:25:30\", \"Description\": \"\", \"DicNameList\": \"合同\", \"SystemStatus\": 1, \"VectorModelID\": 12, \"VisionModelID\": 10, \"LastUpdateTime\": \"2026-05-11T09:24:37\", \"LineSliceCount\": 1000, \"OverlapSection\": 20, \"ParagraphSlice\": 1000, \"KnowledgeBaseID\": \"331b05695839cef8acce37bbe7ee08c0\", \"VectorModelName\": \"embeddinggemma\", \"VisionModelName\": \"千问2.5vl:7b\", \"PreprocessModelID\": 13, \"PreprocessModelName\": \"UCloud(Qwen/Qwen3-32B)\", \"EnableImageProcessing\": true}], \"EmbeddingModel\": {\"LargeModelID\": 12}, \"MaxConcurrency\": 15, \"NativeFunction\": [], \"ResponseFormat\": \"text\", \"FallbackMessage\": \"抱歉，我暂时无法回答您的问题，请稍后再试或联系人工客服。\", \"FusedResultTopN\": 5, \"EnableEscalation\": false, \"EscalationNodeID\": null, \"GreetingPatterns\": [\"你好\", \"您好\", \"嗨\", \"hello\", \"hi\", \"在吗\"], \"MaxContextChunks\": null, \"SemanticFunction\": [], \"ConfidenceWeights\": {\"SourceWeight\": 0.25, \"QualityWeight\": 0.15, \"RecencyWeight\": 0.15, \"FeedbackWeight\": 0.1, \"SimilarityWeight\": 0.35}, \"MinRetrievalScore\": 0.3, \"ShowSourceCitation\": false, \"VectorSearchWeight\": 2, \"SimilarityThreshold\": 0.3, \"FullTextSearchWeight\": 0.3, \"LowConfidenceThreshold\": 0.3, \"HighConfidenceThreshold\": 0.85, \"MediumConfidenceThreshold\": 0.5, \"SimpleConversationPatterns\": [\"谢谢\", \"感谢\", \"再见\", \"拜拜\", \"好的\", \"知道了\", \"嗯\"]}, \"name\": null, \"type\": \"ServiceDesk\", \"style\": {}, \"mainid\": \"15c5fb785f4ce8a99717ea85f29690c9\